# Exactly one CODEOWNERS file in this repository. GitHub searches .github/,
# then the root, then docs/, and uses the first it finds -- two copies that
# drift is a silent trap.
#
# A bare owner with no pattern is invalid, and a malformed CODEOWNERS fails
# OPEN: it satisfies require_code_owner_review vacuously while the pull request
# sidebar still looks armed. Hence the explicit `*`.
#
# Note also that CODEOWNERS is inert on the pull request that introduces it,
# because GitHub reads it from the base branch.
* @marcth
